.TH go-standard 5 "2026-07-24" "go-nix-helpers" "File Formats Manual"
.SH NAME
go-standard \- flake-parts module configuration options for Go projects
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
flake-parts.lib.mkFlake { inherit inputs; } {
  imports = [ inputs.go-nix-helpers.flakeModules.go-standard ];

  go-standard = {
    pname = "my-project";
    vendorHash = "sha256-...";
    description = "What it does";
    \fI...\fR
  };
};
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B go-standard
module is a
.B flake-parts
module that generates standard Nix flake outputs for Go projects.
It bundles
.B treefmt-nix
internally, so consumers need only three flake inputs:
.BR nixpkgs ,
.BR flake-parts ,
and
.BR go-nix-helpers .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR pname " (str, required)"
Package name. Used as the overlay attribute and mainProgram.
.TP
.BR vendorHash " (null|str, default: null)"
Vendor hash for buildGoModule. Use null for committed vendor directories.
.TP
.BR src " (path, default: self.outPath)"
Source path for the Go module.
.TP
.BR version " (str, default: self.rev or self.dirtyRev or \"dev\")"
Version string for the package.
.TP
.BR description " (str, default: \"A LarsArtmann Go project\")"
Short description for package meta.
.TP
.BR systems " (list str, default: [\"x86_64-linux\" \"aarch64-linux\" \"x86_64-darwin\" \"aarch64-darwin\"])"
Systems to build for. Override to restrict or extend.
.TP
.BR subPackages " (list str, default: [\".\"])"
Go subPackages to build.
.TP
.BR packages " (attrs, default: {})"
Additional packages for monorepo support. Each entry generates a separate
buildGoModule with its own subPackages.
.TP
.BR goPkgAttr " (str, default: \"go_1_26\")"
Go package attribute in nixpkgs.
.TP
.BR enableCheck " (bool, default: true)"
Run go test during the Nix build (doCheck).
.TP
.BR enableOverlay " (bool, default: true)"
Generate flake.overlays.default.
.TP
.BR enableTempl " (bool, default: false)"
Include templ in devShells and treefmt.
.TP
.BR enableGovulncheck " (bool, default: true)"
Include govulncheck in the default devShell.
.TP
.BR enableGopls " (bool, default: true)"
Include gopls in the default devShell.
.TP
.BR enableGolangciLint " (bool, default: true)"
Include golangci-lint in devShells and the lint app.
.TP
.BR enableGofumpt " (bool, default: true)"
Enable gofumpt in treefmt programs.
.TP
.BR enableGoimports " (bool, default: true)"
Enable goimports in treefmt programs.
.TP
.BR enableNixfmt " (bool, default: true)"
Enable nixfmt in treefmt programs.
.TP
.BR enableCompletions " (bool, default: false)"
Install shell completions for the default binary.
.TP
.BR buildFlags " (list str, default: [])"
Extra build flags passed to go build (e.g. build tags).
.TP
.BR deps " (attrs path, default: {})"
Private Go deps for mkPreparedSource.
.TP
.BR subModules " (attrs, default: {})"
Explicit sub-modules (merged with auto-discovered).
.TP
.BR autoGoPrivate " (bool, default: true)"
Auto-inject GOPRIVATE when deps are set.
.TP
.BR validatePrivateDeps " (bool, default: true)"
Fail build if a private require lacks a replace.
.TP
.BR privateDepPattern " (str, default: \"github\\\\.com/[Ll]ars[Aa]rtmann/\")"
ERE regex matching module paths that must have a replace directive.
Override for other organizations.
.TP
.BR publicDeps " (list str, default: [])"
Module paths to exclude from private validation.
Use for repos that match privateDepPattern but are actually public.
.TP
.BR proxyVendor " (bool, default: true)"
Pass proxyVendor to buildGoModule.
.TP
.BR ldflags " (null|list str, default: null)"
Custom ldflags. null = ["-s" "-w" "-X main.version=${version}"].
.TP
.BR extraMeta " (attrs, default: {})"
Extra attributes merged into package meta.
.TP
.BR extraBuildAttrs " (attrs, default: {})"
Extra attributes merged into buildGoModule.
.TP
.BR devShellExtraPackages " (function, default: _: [])"
Function receiving pkgs, returns extra devShell packages.
.TP
.BR shellExtraEnv " (attrs, default: {})"
Extra environment variables for devShells.
.SH OUTPUTS
.TP
.BR packages.default
The compiled binary.
.TP
.BR packages.\\fIpname\\fR
Same package under its own name.
.TP
.BR apps.default
nix run support.
.TP
.BR apps.test
go test -race -v ./...
.TP
.BR apps.lint
golangci-lint run ./...
.TP
.BR apps.fmt
treefmt wrapper.
.TP
.BR devShells.default
Full dev shell with go, gopls, linter, etc.
.TP
.BR devShells.ci
Minimal CI shell.
.TP
.BR checks.format
Treefmt formatting check.
.TP
.BR checks.build
Package build verification.
.TP
.BR overlays.default
Exposes pkgs.\\fIpname\\fR to other flakes.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mkPreparedSource (5),
.BR nix (1),
.BR nix-build (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Lars Artmann <https://github.com/LarsArtmann>
